## Conventions
<%#hasBackend%>
- Backend (`<%backendDir%>/`): see `.ai/rules/backend-python-fastapi.md`.
<%/hasBackend%>
<%#hasWeb%>
- Web (`<%webDir%>/`): see `<%webRuleFile%>`.
<%/hasWeb%>
<%#hasMobile%>
- Mobile (`<%mobileDir%>/`): see `<%mobileRuleFile%>`.
<%/hasMobile%>
- Config via environment variables only; add new ones to `.env.example` and `docker-compose.yml`.
- No `TODO` without an issue reference; no dead code; no commented-out code.

## Done when
`./<%sdlcDir%>/sdlc verify` exits 0 and every AC of the feature is PASS in the report.
